== Effects ==
* Gives a 10% chance of changing the room drop reward to a {{e|Red Heart|text=Heart}}.
* Gives a 33% chance of adding a heart to the rewards from opening certain [[Chest]]s, or destroying [[Tinted Rock]]s, certain [[Machine]]s, and certain [[Beggar]]s.
** Other than Tinted Rocks, these can only drop the heart if they drop [[coin]]s, [[heart]]s, {{e|Bomb}}s, or {{e|Key}}s.
** This includes: {{column list | width = 15em | content =
*** {{E|Chest}}s
*** {{e|Locked Chest}}s
*** {{e|Bomb Chest}}s
*** {{e|Eternal Chest}}s
*** {{e|Spiked Chest}}s
*** {{e|Mimic Chest}}s
*** {{e|Mega Chest}}s
*** {{e|Haunted Chest}}s
*** [[Tinted Rock]]s
*** {{M|Slot Machine}}s
*** {{M|Fortune Telling Machine}}s
*** {{M|Crane Game}}s
*** {{M|Confessional}}s
*** {{m|Beggar}}s
*** {{dlc|nr}} {{m|Devil Beggar}}s
*** {{m|Key Master}}s
*** {{m|Bomb Bum}}s
*** {{m|Battery Bum}}s
}}
** This excludes: {{column list | width = 15em | content =
*** {{e|Red Chest}}s
*** {{e|Old Chest}}s
*** {{e|Wooden Chest}}s
*** {{e|Mom's Chest}}
*** {{m|Blood Donation Machine}}s
*** {{m|Shop Restock Machine}}s
