== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either increases the chance of changing the room drop reward to a {{e|Red Heart||Heart}} to 20% and increases the chance of adding a heart to rewards to 66%. Having both increases these chances to respectively 30% and 100%.

== Notes ==
* Upon using a {{M|Blood Donation Machine}}, there is a chance for the Child's Heart to spawn.
* {{dlc|a+}} {{C|Samson}} will start with Child's Heart after completing [[Ultra Hard]].
* Since the increase of heart drops come at the expense of other [[pickup]]s, if Isaac is short on pickups such as keys and bombs, dropping the trinket by holding the 'Drop' key (default: control) may be beneficial.

